{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e1fcfd863e022c3fa8a9c1bf3c023beda3e54d0e79126ca60061cf98b4f11702", "ja": "アイドルを目指す3人の女の子、\n光駆、水桜、星蘭は、時にぶつかりながら、\n階（きざはし）を駆け上がっていく。", "zh": "光驱、水樱、星兰，\n这三位以成为偶像为目标的女孩子，\n尽管时而碰壁，依然持续向前奔驰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_06_1000_014mir", "source_sha256": "af2160c7e1d71893fdba9392c536fa3709e9658f3481035403a7f58a8e6dfe4d", "ja": "私は、このオーディションに合格して……\nアイドルになる！", "zh": "我要通过这次试镜……成为偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_06_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "1d1c0a8415634488bb3c45abc14171cc39af3c2bc318cf86a5bc1af0dde22244", "ja": "やめなよ！　その子、泣いてるじゃん！", "zh": "快住手！她都在哭了不是吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_06_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "c472f50e60e31e1ac496de8c1cd27cf06310ed892974f36a71143e8a11bccc07", "ja": "忠告しておいてあげる。\n軒を貸して母屋を取られないように、気をつけなさい。", "zh": "我给你个忠告。\n可别好心借了屋檐，反倒被人家鸠占鹊巢了，自己小心点吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_06_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "801508e64f0112bac1f91ac39912292a86f00b2d4df30d153723bf53af77b2db", "ja": "あんな上手な人、いるんだね……。", "zh": "竟然有那么厉害的人啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_06_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "9a16bbaf7b3d6a70bd5e56ada2367c7ade5109ee525fa6938841ca17fafec0e6", "ja": "数多くの『天才』を排出してる家なの。\n中でも星蘭さんは……。", "zh": "那个家族培养出了不少“天才”呢。\n其中的星兰小姐更是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_06_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "b55168a497c33c8d01854c462cf1e552d1e975c3c14b4e8049a9a622ad08ae2d", "ja": "それじゃ、行こうか！\nお互いに頑張ろうね！", "zh": "那我们走吧！\n彼此都加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_06_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "c25170000c6483958b2887d8f1b181472e2476bca32fab88b00aabe9ab20468f", "ja": "ええ。お互いに……。", "zh": "嗯。我们都……去加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_06_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "fda3bbc2b22909b46cd219661f9107372267526abf6c93bfba0cf7595b3d873a", "ja": "わああああ～！？", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_06_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "8967866af7940bbb8158ec3b30d825942e330b092b2be389d6b4c06823283eb5", "ja": "なっ……！？", "zh": "什……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_06_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "7a660f3edaa48b121bad33b3aeb298211a98fda9d2c1a6c84715d336d41fb7c4", "ja": "アイドルは、そんな甘い考えで\nなれるものじゃないの！！", "zh": "偶像可不是抱着那种天真的想法就能当上的！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_06_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "6ff6090af3c578ae308294c6647c6930cf6cec0bdeea4bcb2200f0c27f65fe33", "ja": "その程度の覚悟しかないあなた達に、\nアイドルになる資格なんてない。", "zh": "只有这种程度觉悟的你们，根本没有成为偶像的资格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_06_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "6fec8d0244413ce557c3668877b8e578e4c6d42370b3a0d06fa00a8ce9fa5145", "ja": "いつか自分もあんなふうに輝けるようにって、\n頑張ってきたの！　だから、あなた達には負けない！", "zh": "为了有一天自己也能像那样闪耀，\n我一直努力到现在！所以，我不会输给你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_06_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "fd2252a0663906054e0003bfaba1a4bad25ed3656d62b0506e2673e7f8b8c39e", "ja": "憧れを、この手に掴む。\nそのために……私はステージで、全てを出すんだ！", "zh": "为了能把憧憬紧握手中……\n我要在舞台上，发挥出自己的全部！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
